{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297250","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297250","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1029725001:1":{"text":"收到你们的来信，我和卢卡就在准备迎接你们了。","source_cn":"收到你们的来信，我和卢卡就在准备迎接你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5EB326924860D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029725002:1":{"text":"和预期的时间差不多，看起来最近航路风平浪静。","source_cn":"和预期的时间差不多，看起来最近航路风平浪静。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9205AD1366F7777C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1029725002":{"text":"和预期的时间差不多，看起来最近航路风平浪静。","source_cn":"和预期的时间差不多，看起来最近航路风平浪静。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9205AD1366F7777C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029725003:1":{"text":"好久不见，我与锈锚港的所有人都非常期待与你重逢。","source_cn":"好久不见，我与锈锚港的所有人都非常期待与你重逢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25BB643EE7F43CE3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"好久不见，我与锈锚港的所有人都非常期待与你重逢。","female":"好久不见，我与锈锚港的所有人都非常期待与你重逢。","variant_male_record_index":"102493","variant_female_record_index":"102494","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029725005:1":{"text":"那么，这位新朋友就是信中提到的——","source_cn":"那么，这位新朋友就是信中提到的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CF8D3BB862D239B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029725006:0":{"text":"你好，我是罗万，这次代表秘银商会，想要调查下锈锚港这里的商贸环境——","source_cn":"你好，我是罗万，这次代表秘银商会，想要调查下锈锚港这里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC598A4A9E668231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029725007:0":{"text":"罗万向索尼娅和罗万快速地介绍了他的计划、愿景与本次行动的目标。","source_cn":"罗万向索尼娅和卢卡快速地介绍了他的计划、愿景与本次行动...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x4810EAAE66B83766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029725008:0":{"text":"——综上所述，如果一切顺利，有秘银商会背书，锈锚港就可以与圣石镇建立起直接通商的稳定渠道。","source_cn":"——综上所述，如果一切顺利，有秘银商会背书，锈锚港就可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x373718D2CFB170A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029725009:0":{"text":"棒极了，那么，我会尽快研究下你的计划书，并且整理出目前我们这边可以提供的船只。","source_cn":"棒极了，那么，我会尽快研究下你的计划书，并且整理出目前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA968A9FA059580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029725010:0":{"text":"至于货品……就在锈锚港内到处考察下吧，看看罗万有什么想去的地方。","source_cn":"至于货品……就在锈锚港内到处考察下吧，看看罗万有什么想...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF3CB3F13697572F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"至于货品……就在锈锚港内到处考察下吧，看看罗万有什么想去的地方。","female":"至于货品……就在锈锚港内到处考察下吧，看看罗万有什么想去的地方。","variant_male_record_index":"102502","variant_female_record_index":"102503","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029725011:0":{"text":"唔，但这样的话，我恐怕没法陪你们同行太久……卢卡？","source_cn":"唔，但这样的话，我恐怕没法陪你们同行太久……卢卡？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568A9235852AC9AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029725012:0":{"text":"没问题，交给我就好。","source_cn":"没问题，交给我就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB89C1F29EF0BA4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029725013:0":{"text":"那就这么定了，我先陪诸位到处逛逛，后续详细的介绍就交给卢卡来，如何？","source_cn":"那就这么定了，我先陪诸位到处逛逛，后续详细的介绍就交给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7B8A8D5AA8A8529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029725014:0":{"text":"还是一样雷厉风行啊，索尼娅。","source_cn":"还是一样雷厉风行啊，索尼娅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4036400F3105E1F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029725015:0":{"text":"这正是我理想的合作对象——无论此前的蛮血部落还是锈锚港的诸位，都是一样干脆利索。","source_cn":"这正是我理想的合作对象——无论此前的蛮血部落还是锈锚港...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B558270354C1699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":